1
00:00:07,021 --> 00:00:07,089
[Intro – Female Vocal, Very Soft]

2
00:00:07,061 --> 00:00:13,604
Today  you’ re  going  to  say, “ I  do.”

3
00:00:13,644 --> 00:00:15,931
And  I  am  here,

4
00:00:15,984 --> 00:00:21,016
in  the  very  last  row,

5
00:00:21,048 --> 00:00:22,979
with  all  the  words

6
00:00:23,138 --> 00:00:28,601
I  never  dared  to  tell  you.

7
00:00:28,711 --> 00:00:35,326
I  loved  you  softly,  never  making  a  sound,

8
00:00:35,386 --> 00:00:42,966
the  way  we  love  what  we  are  scared  to  lose.

9
00:00:43,085 --> 00:00:49,708
I  kept  your  name  waiting  on  my  lips,

10
00:00:49,788 --> 00:00:57,303
but  fear  would  never  let  the  words  come  through.

11
00:00:57,351 --> 00:01:00,918
You  told  me  all  about  the  dreams  you  carried,

12
00:01:01,037 --> 00:01:04,508
I  smiled  and  saw  myself  inside  them  too.

13
00:01:04,628 --> 00:01:07,500
I  thought  there’ d  always  be  another  morning

14
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:11,594
to  tell  you  every  dream  I  had  was  you.

15
00:01:11,708 --> 00:01:14,154
Then  came  that  white  invitation,

16
00:01:14,186 --> 00:01:19,029
with  both  your  names  there  side  by  side.

17
00:01:19,069 --> 00:01:22,580
And  in  a  moment,  I  watched  my  tomorrow

18
00:01:22,620 --> 00:01:25,646
become  the  life  another  woman  would  live.

19
00:01:25,757 --> 00:01:29,350
And  now  you’ re  saying, “ I  do,”

20
00:01:29,384 --> 00:01:33,331
while  I  stay  hidden  in  the  silence.

21
00:01:33,391 --> 00:01:35,106
She  takes  the  hand

22
00:01:35,266 --> 00:01:40,548
I  only  ever  held  inside  my  dreams.

23
00:01:40,595 --> 00:01:44,242
You  promise  her  a  lifetime  by  your  side,

24
00:01:44,362 --> 00:01:47,354
I  hide  my  broken  heart  behind  a  smile.

25
00:01:47,394 --> 00:01:54,774
I’ ve  lost  you  without  ever  having  you,

26
00:01:54,814 --> 00:02:02,264
because  I  was  too  scared  to  say, “ I  love  you.”

27
00:02:02,334 --> 00:02:05,856
You  look  so  handsome,  dressed  in  your  future,

28
00:02:05,888 --> 00:02:09,048
just  like  that  evening  outside  my  door,

29
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:13,037
when  you  asked  me, “ Is  there  something  you’ re  not  telling  me?”

30
00:02:13,053 --> 00:02:16,317
and  I  whispered  softly, “ No,  nothing  at  all.”

31
00:02:16,330 --> 00:02:20,835
Now  she  is  walking  slowly  there  to  meet  you,

32
00:02:20,925 --> 00:02:23,936
wearing  the  white  I  know  I’ ll  never  wear.

33
00:02:24,016 --> 00:02:27,048
And  every  step  that  brings  her  any  closer

34
00:02:27,148 --> 00:02:31,064
closes  a  door  I’ ll  never  open  again.

35
00:02:31,177 --> 00:02:34,269
For  just  a  moment,  you  look  for  my  eyes,

36
00:02:34,388 --> 00:02:38,351
I  turn  away  before  they  tell  the  truth.

37
00:02:38,404 --> 00:02:40,971
If  I  called  out  your  name  right  now,

38
00:02:41,011 --> 00:02:44,293
would  that  be  love— or  only  selfishness?

39
00:02:44,331 --> 00:02:50,653
And  now  you’ re  saying, “ I  do,”

40
00:02:50,687 --> 00:02:54,634
while  I  stay  hidden  in  the  silence.

41
00:02:54,694 --> 00:02:56,410
She  takes  the  hand

42
00:02:56,569 --> 00:03:01,851
I  only  ever  held  inside  my  dreams.

43
00:03:01,899 --> 00:03:05,546
You  promise  her  a  lifetime  by  your  side,

44
00:03:05,665 --> 00:03:09,495
I  hide  my  broken  heart  behind  a  smile.

45
00:03:09,574 --> 00:03:16,077
I’ ve  lost  you  without  ever  having  you,

46
00:03:16,117 --> 00:03:24,420
because  I  was  too  scared  to  say, “ I  love  you.”

47
00:03:24,425 --> 00:03:24,565
[Bridge – Emotional Crescendo]

48
00:03:24,499 --> 00:03:27,587
I  could  have  loved  you  in  the  open  sunlight,

49
00:03:27,647 --> 00:03:31,630
laughed  with  you  in  a  home  too  small  for  two,

50
00:03:31,664 --> 00:03:35,067
fought  over  nothing,  then  made  up  by  midnight,

51
00:03:35,186 --> 00:03:38,394
woken  every  morning  next  to  you.

52
00:03:38,441 --> 00:03:41,888
But  love  that  never  finds  the  strength  to  speak

53
00:03:41,968 --> 00:03:44,309
can  never  turn  the  hands  of  destiny.

54
00:03:44,335 --> 00:03:49,149
So  I  will  let  you  walk  away  beside  her

55
00:03:49,255 --> 00:03:55,541
and  carry  this  secret  inside  of  me.

56
00:03:55,546 --> 00:03:55,753
[Final Chorus – Full Vocal, Rising Orchestra]

57
00:03:55,659 --> 00:03:59,270
And  now  you’ ve  said, “ I  do,”

58
00:03:59,304 --> 00:04:03,311
while  all  my  world  collapses  in  the  silence.

59
00:04:03,351 --> 00:04:05,106
She  holds  the  hand

60
00:04:05,266 --> 00:04:10,516
I  never  had  the  courage  to  reach  for.

61
00:04:10,548 --> 00:04:14,242
You’ ve  promised  her  a  lifetime  by  your  side,

62
00:04:14,362 --> 00:04:17,354
I  give  to  you  my  last  and  fragile  smile.

63
00:04:17,394 --> 00:04:24,854
I’ ve  lost  you  without  ever  having  you,

64
00:04:24,894 --> 00:04:33,443
because  I  was  too  scared  to  say, “ I  love  you.”

65
00:04:33,454 --> 00:04:33,762
[Finale – Orchestra Fading]

66
00:04:33,642 --> 00:04:35,984
Maybe  in  another  life

67
00:04:36,144 --> 00:04:39,562
I’ ll  find  a  voice  that’ s  brave  enough.

68
00:04:39,628 --> 00:04:44,641
Maybe  I’ ll  reach  you  before  the  fear  does,

69
00:04:44,681 --> 00:04:49,635
and  I’ ll  be  the  woman  by  your  side.

70
00:04:49,639 --> 00:04:49,773
[Outro – Broken Voice, Almost Spoken]

71
00:04:49,713 --> 00:04:53,458
You  take  her  face  between  your  hands.

72
00:04:53,537 --> 00:04:56,266
I  lower  my  eyes.

73
00:04:56,314 --> 00:04:59,322
And  here  inside  my  silence,

74
00:04:59,441 --> 00:05:02,622
I  finally  tell  you:

75
00:05:02,243 --> 00:05:07,301
“ I  love  you.”

76
00:05:07,340 --> 00:05:10,851
But  you  can’ t  hear  me  anymore.